@understand
title: Try to Understand Stewie
subtitle: Sometimes, Stewie can speak to people, such as Brian, but Peter and Lois have no idea what he is saying. Let's try to fix this
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and stewie_language < 6
on-arrival: month_actions = 1; stewie_language += 1;

Peter spends some time talking to Stewie, but with little luck.

@fund_project
title: Fund a new project
subtitle: Increase Stewie's influence and reduce his dissatisfaction, at Peter's expense.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions = 1; stewie_strength += 5; stewie_dissent -= 8; peter_dissent += 2; advisor_action_timer = 6;

Influence +5; Stewie dissatisfaction −8; Peter dissatisfaction +2.

- @root: Return to main

@keep_occupied
title: Keep Stewie occupied
subtitle: Reduce Stewie's dissatisfaction, but Chris gets frustrated.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions = 1; stewie_dissent -= 10; chris_dissent += 2; lois_dissent -= 2; advisor_action_timer = 6;

Stewie dissatisfaction −10; Chris dissatisfaction +2; Lois dissatisfaction −2.

- @root: Return to main
